region-around-500-kilometres-above-the-planet</link><description>主要用于互联网连接的星链卫星网络为科学家提供了一种新方法来研究地球大气层中最难观测的区域之一。根据京都大学研究人员的一项研究，来自大约 1,200 颗星链卫星的公开轨道数据被用来估计高度约 482 公里的热层密度。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/researchers-turned-data-from-roughly-1200-starlink-satellites-into-a-giant-scanner-for-earths-upper-atmosphere-mapping-a-hardtoobserve-region-around-500-kilometres-above-the-planet.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 23:05:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/researchers-turned-data-from-roughly-1200-starlink-satellites-into-a-giant-scanner-for-earths-upper-atmosphere-mapping-a-hardtoobserve-region-around-500-kilometres-above-the-planet</guid></item><item><title>NASA 的宇航员训练中心将如何与商业空间站发生变化？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-will-nasas-astronaut-training-hub-change-with-commercial-space-stations</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 22:50:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-will-nasas-astronaut-training-hub-change-with-commercial-space-stations</guid></item><item><title>美光科技向美国新研究实验室投入 100 亿美元，用于开发后 DRAM 和 NAND 技术及封装</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/micron-commits-10-billion-to-new-usbased-research-labs-to-target-postdram-and-nand-technologies-and-packaging</link><description>一起工作总是更好。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/micron-commits-10-billion-to-new-usbased-research-labs-to-target-postdram-and-nand-technologies-and-packaging.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 22:35:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/micron-commits-10-billion-to-new-usbased-research-labs-to-target-postdram-and-nand-technologies-and-packaging</guid></item><item><title>不平衡数学的“巨大突破”</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/huge-breakthrough-in-the-math-of-imbala